{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/RunQuadRun.png?t=1747566625\" />Run Quad Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Qubicland needs your reflexes and skills to recover the lost artifacts. Inspired by the difficult skill games of browser games era, Run Quad Run brings you a lot of new enemies and a colorful world to discover. Easy to learn, hard to master. With over 300 levels, the game offers features to both starters and hardcore players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Features.png?t=1747566625\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ Levels to finish and speedrun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Boss Escapes &amp; 20 Long Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Speed modifiers for starter players &amp; more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End-game content for hardcore players &amp; more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Never_Give_Up.png?t=1747566625\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Never Give Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're new to the genre, we've got you covered with a few features that'll help you easily play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">p.s. We recommend you to play the game on default difficulty on your first playthrough. However, it is not mandatory. You can still get the achievements with the reduced difficulty settings. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Real_Runners.png?t=1747566625\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real Runners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're on the hardcore side of the player-base and you'd like to <strong>Speedrun</strong> the game, we also have a death counter and a global timer to count your cumulative stats. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733970?t=1747566625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/84de6ebdc9d611c4ccca17b64d0cacf60d453cd8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747566625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/11556bfec45ad73f09a9513e85ebf753fd9475b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747566625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/11556bfec45ad73f09a9513e85ebf753fd9475b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747566625","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/RunQuadRun.png?t=1747566625\" />Run Quad Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Qubicland needs your reflexes and skills to recover the lost artifacts. Inspired by the difficult skill games of browser games era, Run Quad Run brings you a lot of new enemies and a colorful world to discover. Easy to learn, hard to master. With over 300 levels, the game offers features to both starters and hardcore players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Features.png?t=1747566625\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ Levels to finish and speedrun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Boss Escapes &amp; 20 Long Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Speed modifiers for starter players &amp; more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End-game content for hardcore players &amp; more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Never_Give_Up.png?t=1747566625\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Never Give Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're new to the genre, we've got you covered with a few features that'll help you easily play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">p.s. We recommend you to play the game on default difficulty on your first playthrough. However, it is not mandatory. You can still get the achievements with the reduced difficulty settings. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Real_Runners.png?t=1747566625\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real Runners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're on the hardcore side of the player-base and you'd like to <strong>Speedrun</strong> the game, we also have a death counter and a global timer to count your cumulative stats. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p>","developers":["Chelafinx"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/d7c7bbe73ec6d43b1295e0851b8084a6e36c42c7/header.jpg?